# 本地開發用環境變數範例 / Example local dev environment variables
# 複製此檔為 .dev.vars 並填入實際值（.dev.vars 已被 gitignore）
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in the real values (.dev.vars is gitignored)
LINE_CHANNEL_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-line-channel-access-token-here
LINE_CHANNEL_SECRET=your-line-channel-secret-here
ASK_MODEL=@cf/moonshotai/kimi-k2.6
ASK_ARCHIVE_BASE_URL=https://archive.tw
# CAG 預設檢索器（vectorize|archive）；可不設，預設 vectorize（無索引時自動回退 archive）
CAG_RETRIEVER=vectorize

# ── Cloudflare 帳號（vectorize:sync 嵌入 REST 需要）────────────────────────────
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your-cloudflare-account-id
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your-workers-ai-api-token
#
# wrangler 子行程（d1 / vectorize / r2）本機預設走 OAuth（wrangler login），
# 不會讀取這裡的 CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN，以免僅 Workers AI 權限的 token
# 蓋過 OAuth 並令 d1 / vectorize 失敗。token 只供 vectorize:sync 的 REST 嵌入。
# GitHub Actions 無 OAuth，會自動把 CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN 傳給 wrangler。
# 若要在本機強制 wrangler 也用 token：WRANGLER_USE_API_TOKEN=1
#
# Cloudflare account (vectorize:sync REST embedding only)
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your-cloudflare-account-id
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your-workers-ai-api-token
#
# Wrangler subprocesses (d1 / vectorize / r2) use OAuth locally (wrangler login)
# and ignore CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN here, so a Workers-AI-only token does not
# shadow OAuth and break d1 / vectorize. The token is only for vectorize:sync
# REST embedding. GitHub Actions has no OAuth and passes the token to wrangler.
# To force wrangler to use the token locally: WRANGLER_USE_API_TOKEN=1